==German==

===Etymology===
Calque of {{etyl|nl|de}} {{m|nl|boekerij}}, {{suffix|Buch|gloss1=book|ei|lang=de}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bʏçəˈʁaɪ/|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|aɪ̯|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f}}

# [[library]]

====Declension====
{{de-decl-noun-f|en}}

====Usage notes====
The word is commonly used only for town libraries or private libraries, while university libraries are almost exclusively called ''Bibliothek''.

